#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:1
msgid "Metrics and rolling windows"
msgstr "指标与滚动窗口"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:3
msgid ""
"Metric functions consume a `fincore::dataframe` and return typed scalars or "
"series. Units are decimal returns unless the API says otherwise. `NaN` "
"inputs are missing; a window is evaluable only when its documented "
"completeness rule is satisfied."
msgstr ""
"指标函数接收 `fincore::dataframe`，并返回类型化的标量或序列。除非 API 另有说"
"明，单位均为小数收益率。`NaN` 输入表示缺失；只有当窗口满足其文档说明的完整性"
"规则时，该窗口才可计算。"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:8
msgid "Scalar risk/return metrics are in `include/fincore/metrics/`."
msgstr "标量风险/收益指标位于 `include/fincore/metrics/` 中。"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:9
msgid ""
"Rolling and multi-column statistics are in `metrics/rolling.hpp` and "
"`rolling_engine.hpp`."
msgstr ""
"滚动统计与多列统计位于 `metrics/rolling.hpp` 和 `rolling_engine.hpp` 中。"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:11
msgid ""
"Date-wise and period summaries preserve the input ordering rules stated in "
"their API entries."
msgstr "按日期和按周期的汇总遵循其 API 条目中声明的输入排序规则。"

#: ../../site/guides/metrics.md:14
msgid ""
"Use the numerator/denominator conventions described by the function rather "
"than assuming that two similarly named metrics annualize or handle ties the "
"same way. The API reference is generated from the public headers."
msgstr ""
"请使用函数所描述的分子/分母约定，而不要假设两个名称相似的指标会以相同方式年化"
"或处理并列值。API 参考由公共头文件生成。"
